      "id": 17,
      "options": {
        "content": "## MLOps System Health\n\nInfrastructure and API health overview: API request rates, error rate, P95 latency, container resource usage, PostgreSQL monitoring, and service probe status.\n\n### Key Panels\n| Panel | What to look for |\n|:------|:-----------------|\n| Error Rate (%) | Should stay below 5% \u2014 above 10% triggers `CriticalErrorRate` alert |\n| P95 Latency | Should stay below 500ms \u2014 above triggers `HighLatency` alert |\n| Container Memory/CPU | Per-container resource trends via cAdvisor |\n| Nginx / Airflow / MLflow Probes | HTTP health probes \u2014 green = UP, red = DOWN |\n| Host System Resources | Node Exporter CPU/memory/disk \u2014 Linux/macOS only (empty on Windows) |\n\n**Data sources:** `api_requests_total`, `api_errors_total`, `api_request_duration_seconds`, `container_memory_usage_bytes`, `container_cpu_usage_seconds_total`, `probe_success`, `pg_stat_activity_count`, `node_cpu_seconds_total`\n\n*Last updated: Session 10 \u2014 GF-15/17 probe panels added, duplicate panel removed*",
